{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_VERBOSE__"}}----
Intrinsic define (macro value) set by the compiler

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	""__FB_VERBOSE__""
##
{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	##""__FB_VERBOSE__""## indicates whether verbose mode is active at the current point in compilation.

	Returns non-zero (-1) if the ##-v## compiler option has been enabled, including by a source ###cmdline## directive. Returns zero (0) otherwise.

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.4

{{fbdoc item="ex"}}
%%(freebasic)
#if __FB_VERBOSE__ <> 0
	#print Verbose mode
#else
	#print Normal mode
#endif
%%

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- [[CompilerOptv|Compiler Option: -v]]
	- ##[[KeyPgPpcmdline|#cmdline]]##
	- ##[[KeyPgDdcmdline|__CMDLINE__]]##

{{fbdoc item="back" value="CatPgDddefines|Intrinsic Defines"}}
